{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05171","headline":"游㴩湖上寺 · 王琚","name":"游㴩湖上寺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"春山临远壑，水木自幽清。\n夙昔怀微尚，兹焉一放情。\n云间听弄鸟，烟上摘初英。\n地僻方无闷，逾知道思精。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王琚","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05171.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05171","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}